    text: 'Bruna and her team is friendly, respectful of our space and always does a great job! She has been helping with keeping our premises clean for almost a year now and will definitely recommend. It is the little details that matter. The house looks great and our place smells clean.',
    rating: 5,
  },
  {
    id: 7,
    name: 'S V',
