    text: "We have had a wonderful experience with this cleaning service! The team is super friendly, and we especially love their attention to detail, right down to the perfect vacuum lines and the cute paper towel decorations. They consistently go above and beyond, and we couldn't be happier with their work.",
    rating: 5,
  },
  {
    id: 8,
